pantheon-skill-auditor
======================

The `--base <ref>` audit (src/baseline.rs) follows the approach of
skilldiff's src/baseline.ts: read the old version of a skill from a git ref
with `git show` into a temporary folder, without touching the working tree.
The likely-cause remediation lines (src/reporter/remediation.rs) are modelled
on `adviceFor` in skilldiff's src/report.ts.

